# 默认按文本处理并在仓库内统一为 LF，检出时由 core.autocrlf 决定
* text=auto

# 明确二进制，避免换行符转换破坏文件
*.docx binary
*.doc binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary

# Markdown 保持 LF，便于 diff
*.md text eol=lf
